#: ../../monitoring/monitoring.rst:3
msgid "Monitoring |advanced-plus|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/monitoring.rst:8
msgid ""
"Workload Monitoring and Logging are Advanced+ features, available in HPE "
"Morpheus Enterprise and Advanced tiers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/monitoring.rst:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/monitoring.rst:13
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides great monitoring features out of the box. Anything "
"provisioned within |morpheus| automatically gets a check created in the "
"monitoring service. These checks are organized hierarchically in "
"\"Groups\" and \"Apps\". This makes it easy to gain a perspective as to "
"what a customer or full stack facing impact is in the event of a "
"particularly instance failure. This also takes into account redundancy "
"layers when it comes to calculating the applications overall uptime "
"percentage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../monitoring/monitoring.rst:15
msgid "|morpheus| also includes a monitoring integration with ServiceNow."
msgstr ""

